# Evidence: Gap 3 - RA [Houses] + [Base] consumption

## Acceptance Criteria
- `ra_scenario_base_and_credits_applied` green: fixture scenario with [Houses]
  credits/limits and [Base] nodes yields houses with those credits and
  structures at those cells.

## Implementation
1. **house.rs**: `ReinforcementEdge` enum (North/East/South/West/Air/Visible/
   EnemyBase/HomeBase) + `from_name` (case-insensitive token parse), mirroring
   HOUSE.CPP `Edge`; `House` gains `max_buildings`, `edge`, `spawn_slot` fields
   and `with_spawn_slot` builder.
   - NOTE: a subagent attempt died mid-edit leaving an unclosed
     `impl ReinforcementEdge` block and an unclosed `with_spawn_slot` method
     plus a stripped `use std::collections::VecDeque;` import. Repaired in place;
     final state verified by fmt+clippy+tests.
2. **game.rs** `from_original_scenario`:
   - Per-house `[Houses]` records applied **by index** (0=Allies, 1=Soviets —
     the same mapping `Owner=`/`Player=` resolution uses), NOT by name, because
     INI section names (`Greece`/`USSR`) are not the display names.
     Applies Credits (already scaled *100 by parser), TechLevel, MaxUnit,
     MaxBuilding, MaxInfantry, MaxVessels.
   - `[Base]` build-order nodes placed as structures for `base_player`; occupied
     cells warned + skipped (real occupancy check via structures/units cell
     scan — the attempt's `Map::is_occupied`/`Game::unit_at`/`Game::structure_at`
     calls do not exist in the RA crate and were replaced with existing style).

## Verification
- TDD: `ra_scenario_base_and_credits_applied` written (existed from the attempt),
  then made green; ownership: credits=10000/20000, max_units/max_buildings per
  house, POWR@cell16=(0,2), BARR@cell17=(1,2) on the derived 8x8 extent.
- Gate: cargo fmt --check (clean), CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo clippy -p cnc-red-alert
  --all-targets -- -D warnings (clean), CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 cargo test -p cnc-red-alert
  (225 lib + 1 + 14 integration, 0 failed).

## Files Modified
- RUST/cnc-red-alert/src/house.rs (ReinforcementEdge, House fields/builders)
- RUST/cnc-red-alert/src/game.rs (from_original_scenario consumption + test)
